{"3313290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speed Lane", "steam_appid": 3313290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is it?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game I created for relaxation and enjoyment, though it still offers a certain level of challenge. You choose a car, color, track, time, weather—and off you go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in it?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five diverse locations: from a bustling metropolis to snow-covered mountains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy drivers trying to cut you off: the traffic script has been rewritten four times, apologies if it's not perfect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to change time of day and weather on each track: from night races in a blizzard to scorching desert heat during the day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 recognizable cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your car: engine, brakes, nitro, and other components available for installation. Each component has its own quality, so here you might just get that SUPER TURBO MEGA LEGENDARY engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack: synthwave, rock, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards to compete with other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each track is a new challenge. Maneuver through traffic, collect bonuses, and unlock new cars. Choose your path through picturesque locations: from a scorching desert to a cozy remote village. Customize the appearance and performance of your car to create the perfect racing machine for any condition.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is it?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game I created for relaxation and enjoyment, though it still offers a certain level of challenge. You choose a car, color, track, time, weather—and off you go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in it?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five diverse locations: from a bustling metropolis to snow-covered mountains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crazy drivers trying to cut you off: the traffic script has been rewritten four times, apologies if it's not perfect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to change time of day and weather on each track: from night races in a blizzard to scorching desert heat during the day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 recognizable cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your car: engine, brakes, nitro, and other components available for installation. Each component has its own quality, so here you might just get that SUPER TURBO MEGA LEGENDARY engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack: synthwave, rock, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards to compete with other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each track is a new challenge. Maneuver through traffic, collect bonuses, and unlock new cars. Choose your path through picturesque locations: from a scorching desert to a cozy remote village. Customize the appearance and performance of your car to create the perfect racing machine for any condition.</i></p>", "short_description": "This is a dynamic racing game with procedurally generated tracks. Dodge traffic, collect bonuses, and upgrade your car to conquer all routes in any weather. Choose from 10 realistic cars and set new speed records!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Ukrainian, French, German, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313290/header.jpg?t=1765029548", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313290/370bd3ba1cf02a735deb00efa7c384ab61c62807/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=176502954